# Russian style registers: spoken, scientific, official
subtitle: "The same fact in spoken, scientific and official Russian — ну, вро́де бы; явля́ется + the with-case; запреща́ется — as Masha writes a guidebook for children."
tags: ["russian","russian style","registers","official russian","russian writing"]
teaches: ["phrases/registers","phrases/formal-register"]
thumb: "band \"One fact, three styles\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"A children's book in Russian: детский, книжный, дождливый","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/218-russian-childrens-book.cast"}

